51	// (A) HOST orchestration — ATen public entry points. Compiled by the HOST pass
52	// only. The free-standing AMDGCN device gate (__AMDGCN__) does NOT see this
53	// block (torch/extension.h pulls in <cuda.h>/ATen, which the free-standing
54	// device target cannot resolve); the §5 device kernel below is the device-pass
55	// content. On a real hipcc build the host pass compiles this and launches the
56	// §5 kernel via hipLaunchKernelGGL (see §5.LAUNCH).
